{
    "_id": "disgruntled-mai-tai",
    "name": "Disgruntled Mai Tai",
    "instructions": "1. Combine all ingredients except for the Underberg in a cocktail shaker.\n2. Briefly dry shake without ice, then add a few small ice cubes and shake until the ice has melted.\n3. Pour into a chilled rocks glass and top with crushed ice.\n4. Remove the cap and the top of the paper wrapper on the Underberg bottle and insert it, upside-down, into the crushed ice.\n5. Garnish with a mint sprig, lime wedge, grated nutmeg and a cocktail umbrella.",
    "created_at": null,
    "updated_at": null,
    "description": "The Disgruntled Mai Tai is a spin on the rum tiki drink that adds Aperol and a bottle of bitter Underberg to the cocktail.",
